Chris Gangle is an illusionist and the head of remote viewing at the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]]. He is famous enough to be known on sight at a company party, and the people who work beside him find him annoying and cannot say why the company keeps him.

His work is illusions. He conjures images and sounds, puts himself at the centre of whatever room he is in, and carries on through danger like a man on a stage. He says he will remember what he sees, so it can be told later.
